1
00:00:06,605 --> 00:00:09,805
(Amy:)Can you believe it's been
five years since our first date?

2
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:12,380
(Sheldon:)I know.

3
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:17,280
(Sheldon:)Do you think I should start
watching The Flash TV show?

4
00:00:20,387 --> 00:00:23,087
(Amy:)That's what
you're thinking about?

5
00:00:23,090 --> 00:00:25,020
(Sheldon:)Well, one of the things.

6
00:00:25,026 --> 00:00:28,496
(Amy:)Are any of them me?

7
00:00:28,496 --> 00:00:29,526
(Sheldon:)Yes.

8
00:00:29,530 --> 00:00:31,260
I thought, "I can't decide

9
00:00:31,265 --> 00:00:33,165
"if I should watch
The Flash TV show.

10
00:00:33,167 --> 00:00:35,067
I know, I'll ask Amy."

11
00:00:36,336 --> 00:00:38,406
(Sheldon:)Anyway...

12
00:00:39,873 --> 00:00:41,673
(Amy:)What are you doing?

13
00:00:41,675 --> 00:00:44,515
(Sheldon:)You're right, you did
kind of kill the mood.

14
00:00:45,478 --> 00:00:46,878
(Amy:)I didn't kill anything.

15
00:00:46,881 --> 00:00:49,811
(Amy:)You did, talking about
your stupid TV show.

16
00:00:49,817 --> 00:00:51,517
(Sheldon:)Excuse me.

17
00:00:51,519 --> 00:00:54,549
(Sheldon:)Starting to watch a television
show that might run for years

18
00:00:54,555 --> 00:00:56,025
(Sheldon:)isn't a decision
to take lightly.

19
00:00:56,023 --> 00:00:57,623
(Sheldon:)I'm wrestling with

20
00:00:57,625 --> 00:00:59,455
(Sheldon:)a big commitment issue here.

21
00:00:59,460 --> 00:01:00,890
(Amy:)Really?

22
00:01:00,895 --> 00:01:04,635
(Amy:)That's the commitment issue
you're wrestling with?

23
00:01:04,632 --> 00:01:05,902
(Amy:)Sheldon,

24
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:07,730
(Amy:)do you understand the irony

25
00:01:07,735 --> 00:01:10,135
(Amy:)of your fixation on a man
with super speed,

26
00:01:10,137 --> 00:01:12,867
(Amy:)while after five years
all I can get out of you

27
00:01:12,873 --> 00:01:15,443
(Amy:)is a distracted make-out session
on a couch?

28
00:01:17,010 --> 00:01:19,310
(Sheldon:)Irony's not really
my strong suit.

29
00:01:20,447 --> 00:01:22,247
(Sheldon:)But I have been getting better
with sarcasm,

30
00:01:22,249 --> 00:01:24,619
(Sheldon:)if you want to give that a try.

31
00:01:24,618 --> 00:01:27,118
(sarcastically):
Oh, sure, I'd love to.

32
00:01:28,755 --> 00:01:32,025
(Sheldon:)Whenever you're ready.

